{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"小平嵌入"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"小平嵌入"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<h3>复几何</h3>\n<p>设 $M$ 是 $n$ 维紧复流形, 其上有正"},{"Local":{"url":"线丛","text":"线丛"}},{"Plain":" $L$, 则对于足够大的 $n_0$, $M$ 可嵌入射影空间 $\\mathbb P^{n_0}$.</p>\n<h3>代数几何</h3>\n"}]}}